/**
 * @file aisoc_dbus_client.cpp
 * @brief D-Bus Client Remote Method Invocation and Transmission
 * @details Conforms to:
 *          - ICD-VMWARE-SOC-TWIN-20261029 (Rev 2)
 *          - project-control/.agents/rules/c_cpp_coding_standard.md
